 ('ENT_NORR_ASGARD','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','high','Asgard is one of the nine worlds in the standard reconstruction (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_MIDGARD','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','high','Midgard, the human world, is one of the nine worlds.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_VANAHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','medium','Vanaheim is counted among the nine worlds in the standard scholarly list.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_JOTUNHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','high','Jotunheim, land of the giants, is one of the nine worlds.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_NIFLHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','high','Niflheim is one of the nine worlds (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_MUSPELHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','high','Muspelheim is one of the nine worlds (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_ALFHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','medium','Alfheim, home of the light-elves, is one of the nine worlds.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_SVARTALFHEIM','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','medium','Svartalfheim/Nidavellir, realm of dwarves/dark-elves, is one of the nine worlds in the standard list.'),
 ('ENT_NOR_HEL','member_of','ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','medium','Hel (the underworld) completes the standard nine-world enumeration; existing entity ENT_NOR_HEL conflates the ruler and her realm.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_ASGARD','dwelling_of','ENT_NOR_AESIR','high','Asgard is the stronghold of the Æsir (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NOR_ODIN','dwells_in','ENT_NORR_ASGARD','high','Odin resides in Asgard, in his hall Valhalla.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_VANAHEIM','dwelling_of','ENT_NOR_VANIR','high','Vanaheim is the home of the Vanir (Vafþrúðnismál 39).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_JOTUNHEIM','dwelling_of','ENT_NOR_JOTNAR','high','Jotunheim/Utgard is the land of the jötnar (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_SVARTALFHEIM','dwelling_of','ENT_NOR_DWARVES','medium','Svartalfheim/Nidavellir is the subterranean realm of the dwarves and their smithies.'),
 ('ENT_NORR_VALHALLA','member_of','ENT_NORR_ASGARD','high','Valhalla is a hall situated within Asgard (Grímnismál; Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_VALHALLA','dwelling_of','ENT_NOR_EINHERJAR','high','The Einherjar, the chosen slain, feast in Valhalla awaiting Ragnarök.'),
 ('ENT_NOR_ODIN','rules','ENT_NORR_VALHALLA','high','Valhalla is Odin''s hall of the slain.'),
 ('ENT_NOR_VALKYRIES','dwells_in','ENT_NORR_VALHALLA','medium','The Valkyries serve the Einherjar in Valhalla (Grímnismál; Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_FOLKVANGR','ruled_by','ENT_NOR_FREYJA','high','Folkvangr is Freyja''s field where she receives half the battle-slain (Grímnismál 14).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_BIFROST','guarded_by','ENT_NOR_HEIMDALL','high','Heimdall guards Bifröst at the edge of heaven (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_GINNUNGAGAP','associated_with','ENT_NORR_NIFLHEIM','high','Ginnungagap lies between Niflheim and Muspelheim; Niflheim''s rime meets it from the north (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_GINNUNGAGAP','associated_with','ENT_NORR_MUSPELHEIM','high','Muspelheim''s heat meets Ginnungagap from the south, generating Ymir (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_MUSPELHEIM','guarded_by','ENT_NOR_SURTR','high','Surtr stands at the frontier of Muspelheim guarding it with a flaming sword (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_URDARBRUNNR','associated_with','ENT_NOR_YGGDRASIL','high','The Well of Urd lies beneath a root of Yggdrasil where the gods hold court (Völuspá; Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_URDARBRUNNR','associated_with','ENT_NOR_NORNS','high','The Norns dwell by the Well of Urd and water Yggdrasil from it (Völuspá 20).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_MIMISBRUNNR','associated_with','ENT_NOR_YGGDRASIL','high','The Well of Mimir lies beneath a root of Yggdrasil (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_MIMISBRUNNR','associated_with','ENT_NOR_MIMIR','high','Mímir keeps the Well of Wisdom; Odin pledged his eye there (Völuspá 28; Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_NIFLHEIM','associated_with','ENT_NOR_NIDHOGG','medium','Níðhöggr gnaws the root of Yggdrasil in Niflheim beside Hvergelmir (Gylfaginning; Grímnismál).'),
 ('ENT_NOR_JORMUNGANDR','dwells_in','ENT_NORR_MIDGARD','high','Jörmungandr the World Serpent encircles Midgard in the surrounding sea (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_BIFROST','associated_with','ENT_NORR_ASGARD','high','Bifröst connects Midgard to Asgard, the gods'' road into heaven (Gylfaginning).'),
 ('ENT_NORR_NINE_WORLDS','associated_with','ENT_NOR_YGGDRASIL','high','The nine worlds are bound together by the world-tree Yggdrasil, whose roots and branches reach into them.');
